      "source_summary": {
        "content": "To adjust for the 35-42kt storm conditions at Port Delta, we need to update the voyage plan for 'Pacific Carrier'. Please provide the update type (eta_change/destination_change/route_deviation), the corresponding required parameter (e.g., new ETA/destination/waypoints), and the vessel master's name.",
