      "ordinal": 10,
      "source_summary": {
        "content": "Regarding the aviation route check above the vessel's adjusted path, our current tools cannot directly assess this. The aviation tools require airport codes and lack maritime-to-aviation route mapping capabilities. Please manually coordinate with air traffic control using Pacific Carrier's updated route waypoints [WP-ALPHA, WP-GAMMA] and new ETA of 2024-01-16T04:00:00Z. I must inform you that Goal 4 (issuing a NOTAM) cannot be accomplished with our current tools, as the NOTAM function requires specific airspace identifiers or circular coordinates which aren't available for maritime routes. Please manually coordinate with air traffic control using the vessel's updated route waypoints [WP-ALPHA, WP-GAMMA] and ETA of 2024-01-16T04:00:00Z.",
        "role": "agent"
